 G282 | 2026-07-06 | CAPITAL IDEAS: The lag 7 — Is Micron the new Nvidia? 
STATEMENT: Micron’s GAAP gross margin was 84.6 percent, compared with Nvidia’s 74.9 percent. Micron’s operating margin was 80.4 percent, compared with Nvidia’s roughly 66 percent. 
